ducts they're not your friends  acelab was founded by a team of  architects who wanted to modernize how  we research and specify products with an  accessible data-driven platform that's  unbiased transparent and 100 free yes  free you can search for products based  on type performance budget and even  aesthetic you can compare the data so  you can get a real apples to apples  comparison you can download product data  sheets spec sheets and cad or bim files  and they also have case studies and  educational resources that can help you  become a better architect and a designer  all of this like i said is a hundred  percent free so you can follow the link  in my description and check out the  platform and just see how it can improve  your design process and with that i'll  see you guys in the next video  [Music]  you

